WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:03.080
- Welcome back, I couldn't
begin this journey

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:06.450
without two women who have
been a part of my heart

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:08.220
for over 20 years.

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:11.450
We are friends, we are fellow Angels.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.380
Please welcome my partners
in crime and life,

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.327
Lucy Liu and Cameron Diaz.
(audience cheers)

00:00:16.327 --> 00:00:21.327
(funky music)
(women shrieking)

00:00:21.717 --> 00:00:23.758
(Cameron laughs)

00:00:23.758 --> 00:00:28.758
Oh my God, you guys!

00:00:30.606 --> 00:00:33.047
This is the loudest this room has been!

00:00:33.047 --> 00:00:36.257
(women laughing)

00:00:36.257 --> 00:00:39.540
First, I sent Cameron a video

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:44.177
and I'm saying, "Hey, listen,
I wanna ask you something.

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:45.987
"Will you come on the show?"

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:50.330
I've never done this in my life.

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:51.780
Because I'm so comfortable,

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:54.860
I mean, we have lived
together all over the world,

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:56.790
so of course, to save time,

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:59.592
I sent her a video while
I'm getting dressed.

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:01.770
(Cameron and Lucy laughing)
And you don't see anything.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:04.530
I'm not that dumb, but I'm
getting out of the shower

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:07.010
and I'm wringing out of my towel.

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:08.910
And I don't hear back
from her for two days,

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:10.657
and I'm like, "This is weird.

00:01:10.657 --> 00:01:12.480
"Did I, what is going on?"

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:14.527
So I text her and I'm like, "I don't care

00:01:14.527 --> 00:01:16.750
"about the question, are you okay?

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:19.840
I don't hear again for two
days and I'm freaking out.

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:22.567
So I call her and I'm
like, "What is going on?

00:01:22.567 --> 00:01:24.260
"I'm worried, is everything okay?"

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:25.760
She's like, "I don't know
what you're talking about."

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:29.300
I'm like, "The video,
you didn't get my video?"

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:33.628
Turns out, a young boy got the video.

00:01:33.628 --> 00:01:36.400
(audience laughs)
- Lucky him!

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:37.950
- [Drew] Oh, no.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:41.059
- Oh, no, by the way,
it's seven minutes long.

00:01:41.059 --> 00:01:44.650
- Oh my God!
(women laughing)

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:45.850
- It's epic, I mean,

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:46.947
this is some material.
- So many secrets revealed.

00:01:46.947 --> 00:01:50.000
- This kid's gonna have this material.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.242
Honestly, this is gonna last
him three or four years.

00:01:53.242 --> 00:01:55.923
(women laugh)

00:01:55.923 --> 00:01:58.945
- I'm really hamming it up because it's--

00:01:58.945 --> 00:01:59.778
- 'Cause it's you?
- Yeah.

00:01:59.778 --> 00:02:01.040
- Yeah.
- Yeah, it was good.

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:03.017
I was like, "Send me
that video immediately.

00:02:03.017 --> 00:02:06.250
"I need to know what is in that video,"

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:09.660
and the whole while, I'm just cracking up

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:10.660
because it's just--
- You need to send me

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:13.150
this video as well, or do
it through someone else,

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:15.040
because I didn't get
your other video, either.

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:15.873
- So then--
- Someone said,

00:02:15.873 --> 00:02:16.830
- I sent--
- "Did you get her video?"

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:18.060
I was like, "No."

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:19.640
- No, something's wrong with my phone.

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:22.770
So I sent Lucy this video, crying,

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:24.010
inviting her on the show,

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.790
saying--
- In her bathroom, crying.

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:27.735
- I am in my bathroom.
- She was dressed.

00:02:27.735 --> 00:02:30.280
(Cameron and Lucy laugh)
- I was fully clothed

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:31.910
this time, I didn't take the risk,

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:34.114
and she didn't get the video, either!

00:02:34.114 --> 00:02:36.130
(audience laughs)
- Come on.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:37.653
- I know, I know.

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:43.320
The thing that I love about our friendship

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:44.740
is that we have been there

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:47.510
in all the big and important moments.

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:50.720
We've also been there in the small moments

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:52.380
and the casual moments.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:56.370
And the reason we are such good
friends is because it's real

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:58.670
and we go through real
stuff with each other.

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:01.213
It's not a Hollywood fairytale.

